  <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-844db14a-7940-47d2-8ade-99d1387aa43c\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b65ce8b1-222f-4b96-aa03-1e549a515e3b\"><span style=\"color:;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-7ab824d4-602d-441d-b695-87cf7241afc3\">안녕하세요. </span><span style=\"color:#0078cb;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-054f0299-76a1-481f-b041-14210ddb26d7\"><b>승리의 여신: 니케</b></span><span style=\"color:;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-45d2cc69-8b22-4b70-9e98-083668d75e52\">입니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-70df9284-ce96-41d0-8be7-09c24f92e7a9\"><span style=\"color:;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-db5a2fc4-b3ee-42c7-a755-4216e5e8783e\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-01ad131a-8d43-468a-b133-3f2a5446ea24\"><span style=\"color:;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-32e285b6-c358-4b47-8927-0453e4a63cfc\">6/15(월) 23:00 ~ 6/16(화) 00:30 경에</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-24fef972-0664-4c31-b339-64b83ae9bcb5\"><span style=\"color:;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-cedd3768-528d-40fe-b69b-89971c44f451\">무점검 업데이트가 진행되었습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-6869670e-3146-4422-9527-7f3f68191cd1\"><span style=\"color:;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-4dd8627f-e7f9-4a11-b2b7-f1d18fd650d4\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3b936f18-ba73-4bed-a726-a9c1f6f653b2\"><span style=\"color:;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-8e1151d1-126e-4239-b758-a20e8105824e\">게임을 완전히 종료하신 후 재접속하여</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ae96923c-7ce4-4f64-b4cd-229037b214e9\"><span style=\"color:;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-cdbcde67-bdff-4658-aa6e-73ff5904b426\">업데이트 리소스를 다운로드해 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-559467a2-4a15-49eb-b36a-10e6be55ee2d\"><span style=\"color:;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-c7c3bfa3-8f51-48d2-acc4-e08553e65502\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0da7ea3e-2f9c-4fe5-8515-8400ba4f9a91\"><span style=\"color:;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-5d900471-0caf-4679-bf59-7e7a479d244d\">·····················································································</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d5d529d7-1f5d-4017-8111-e0906d736c25\"><span style=\"color:;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-13432c1e-1e54-4164-af2e-eda4d5cad808\"><b>📢 6/15(월) 무점검 업데이트 안내</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-57e55f01-0bb8-4814-9195-3239410271f0\"><span style=\"color:;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-853c0f55-e99c-4745-bae2-e33db3725276\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a1fff77e-981e-4d7e-be20-2c52a4b4f6a0\"><span style=\"color:;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-9478f7a4-8bb3-43d0-be97-79cb8c99251a\"><b>✔️ 일시</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-759b9f2a-556c-4b3f-a80a-2fff1d57d13d\"><span style=\"color:;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-21f2d6bf-b39b-4a96-8f70-75a6a6241b6c\">- 6/15(월) 23:00 ~ 6/16(화) 00:30 경</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-74f32718-e8b3-4201-87de-6b82046d2d30\"><span style=\"color:;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-e7482eb9-70ed-4096-aced-b49bcb091e99\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b5e88c03-8d37-4f91-8ddf-68d0453b364e\"><span style=\"color:;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-3a99c250-b73c-4099-83c4-1cf838eff56a\"><b>✔️ 내용</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-799f85e5-06df-46a3-a46c-bf7ad731d52c\"><span style=\"color:;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-5cc7fbcf-f1cb-4eb1-b4cb-2edaccc8afb4\">1. 튜토리얼 진행 중 캠페인 2챕터 진입 시, 화면이 어색한 위치를 비추는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-6dcfd51d-e83a-42ef-a359-a4ebe8c13124\"><span style=\"color:;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-dacb38ae-be34-4345-89b3-236646c09597\">2. 특정 상황에서 미니 게임 FIGHT! ARK RANGER!의 상점 - 무기 선택 영역에 흰색 박스가 표시되는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9c97d4f6-2ddc-4955-99cc-d51efed2cbbd\"><span style=\"color:;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-2f62e79e-ebe4-471b-9fe1-f4b533f45ae8\">3. 이벤트 필드 ARK RANGER의 입장 연출에 일부 이펙트를 추가하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-88557698-84ec-48df-97bd-c06432657e70\"><span style=\"color:;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-3881baeb-0439-4d35-a730-7b0e4f26d6fd\">4. 일부 그래픽 설정에서 이벤트 필드 ARK RANGER의 배경 그래픽 효과를 컨셉에 좀 더 어울리도록 조정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-26c529c4-0128-49d8-b88d-3a08fe110dc5\"><span style=\"color:;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-a2201cb2-c4e0-4b25-8049-30036a2fac6d\">5. 목단 - 화중지왕의 사격 자세에서 특정 부위가 어색하게 보이는 현상 완화하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-cbebc871-8148-4396-889f-ed4a87880628\"><span style=\"color:;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-4d9d97e5-b6dd-48ba-88f1-c469bcd83699\">└ 개선 작업은 지속적으로 진행 중이며, 관련 진행 상황은 추후 공지를 통해 안내드리겠습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d16e1a80-d65e-49a8-bac9-d2869daccfca\"><span style=\"color:;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-36e3c1f4-f736-463a-be46-ca6b876f459d\">6. 미니 게임 FIGHT! ARK RANGER! 플레이 후, 타이틀 화면으로 진입할 경우 필터 효과가 중복 적용되는 현상을 완화하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-76751ef8-35e1-4423-88e7-fe34638a3b0e\"><span style=\"color:;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-a9396289-0ac0-4a7d-a92f-c6e65d4d5480\">7. 유니온 레이드 랭킹이 표시되지 않는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e7de46c4-8923-4788-8c18-4b11da00c91a\"><span style=\"color:;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-2b67f8cb-0589-4be0-a100-8f3ee1f2c28e\">└ 유니온 레이드의 전투 기록은 모두 정상 저장되었으며, 랭킹 순위에 영향을 주지 않습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b156b0de-a0c4-49b7-b833-0f7cf31f48bc\"><span style=\"color:;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-5b5f7b5c-8198-47ef-b607-d4e17dbf6575\">8. 특정 상황에서 미니 게임 FIGHT! ARK RANGER!에서 업적의 진행도가 잘못 표시되는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a46665d6-3755-428b-a94a-304301e22e6e\"><span style=\"color:;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-da7246d2-627c-43fb-a0f9-c49d233d0a80\">└ 기존에 달성한 업적 기록은 정상적으로 갱신되었습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-759d29b0-4fc3-4b45-ad56-8faecf42cb41\"><span style=\"color:;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-ee9c6758-1ad1-4869-9946-d122bba1f59d\">└ 미니 게임 진입 시, 업적 기록 갱신에 따른 레드닷이 표시됩니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-fa1a2f47-30b1-4b61-99e9-3cc33adb812b\"><span style=\"color:;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-9acaec32-06c5-48cf-8370-0098e8b8c48e\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7a9b95e4-f6f2-468d-ae52-d8d4fa0b71e5\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-7c18ec3b-98bf-4646-95c1-42833a313bb4\">※ 게임 재접속 후 업데이트 리소스 다운로드를 부탁드립니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2ce7f13e-761b-47da-ae24-3edb62b676f1\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-a9110a11-6b1a-46f7-8a73-708acb22af50\">※ 인앱 구매(확률형 아이템 포함)</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2b59d370-33ae-4230-8e70-990a239ce6a4\"><span style=\"color:;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-e77cbd42-a9ef-4734-8e39-b68bbcf031fa\">·····················································································</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-501c4b45-44f5-42a1-96e2-e0606b91d25d\"><span style=\"color:;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-f299b629-a77a-4e25-9e22-14fd756ce5fb\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a9f4faa5-43cc-4302-916f-008f6af05432\"><span style=\"color:;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-93c4ed83-b168-41c3-b860-5ca48f863d75\">게임 이용에 불편을 드린 점 깊이 사과드립니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <script type=\"text/data\" class=\"__se_module_data\" data-module-v2='{\"type\": \"v2_text\", \"id\": \"SE-844db14a-7940-47d2-8ade-99d1387aa43c\", \"data\": {\"ctype\": \"text\"  }}'></script>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-be0411cd-e4ef-4fe5-b3a6-44c94cdc7f5f\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-normal\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-\" style=\"max-width:100px;\">\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" onclick=\"return false;\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata='{\"id\" : \"SE-be0411cd-e4ef-4fe5-b3a6-44c94cdc7f5f\", \"src\" : \"https://nng-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjA2MTVfMjUg/MDAxNzgxNTE4NTE5NTI4.UZiAGxY2PayV6JYbKlgK0nHLbtEDlLc7a-F_H_8-hzQg.mRH1lAosBSVoUcI07PFTODSw1hqQEUvQZwHFzrmLFgcg.PNG/241030_%EC%97%85%EB%8D%B0%EC%9D%B4%ED%8A%B8_100x100.png?ty